XOR rectangle: corner (10,10) = 0
corner (100,60) = 0, edge (50,10) = 15
(15 means the corner is drawn, 0 that it was XORed away)
palette regs before: 0 = 0, 1 = 1
after SetPalette(1, EGALightRed = 60), SetBkColor(1):
   0 = 60, 1 = 60, GetBkColor = 1
(reg 0 = 60: uses the palette entry; = 1: the default colour 1)
